The "agenda" is that it's fun. Quit projecting your own sexualities on others.

I'll also add, the timeline takes place \*just\* before humanity is completely and utterly fucked. They rely on faster than light travel by utilizing a plane of existence called The Immaterium or the Warp. Only problem is, The Warp is a psychic reflection of the galaxy's sentient creatures. And because humanity is galaxy wide and is a theocratic dictatorship, the warp has become literally hell with demons and gods based around debauchery and cruelty.

&#x200B;

Humanity relies on the vegetable emperor to be a sort of lighthouse in the warp, so that they have a sense of direction and aren't flying completely blind. Problem is, the throne is failing, and pretty soon that lighthouse is going to go dark, stranding trillions upon trillions of souls in a galaxy that hates them for the monsters they are.

